  "details": "since a lot of people don't care about or don't like optimizing their avatars they can take up a lot of space and impact performance a lot. what if players had an option to set a max resulution for avatar textures.\n\nfor example someone has an agayar uploaded with full 4k textures. in your settings have an option to put max resolution to let's say 1024 or 512. this will give a better experience to people with a less powerful pc or in lobbies with a lot of people\n\nAnother way to implement this is to have avis load with low res textures initially, speeding up loading times and reducing lag. then it will load and apply the full res texture in the background wil you're exploring the lobby",
